@startuml
' Transfer21.10 by Codex / Manager, explicit Owner instruction.
' Analyst2736e28 + Owner19-21.10; original source in transfer_map.md.
title Accepted chart: one DTO, retained HTML and passive SVG
autonumber
hide footbox
actor User
participant "Page / session coordinator" as Page
participant "Existing HTTP API" as API
participant "Existing correlated HTTP log" as Log
control "Accepted facts / HTML" as Facts
participant "Passive SVG boundary" as Wheel
User -> Page : open / reload / foreground
Page -> API : POST /session/bootstrap {}
API -> Log : request_id / existing send, receive and terminal events
API --> Page : ready + state_version (not a chart)
Page -> API : GET /charts/current
API -> Log : existing correlated current request
alt valid chart_ready (current or explicit committed POST)
 API --> Page : validated DTO + birth + stale
 Page -> Page : accepted snapshot / unique acceptanceSeq / cause
 Page -> Facts : same accepted source + submitted intent
 Facts -> Facts : full source S1 index BEFORE subset; consume acceptance once
 Facts -> Facts : reset or preserve/reconcile according to cause
 Facts -> Wheel : immutable snapshot for current revision
 alt normal mode
  Facts --> User : summary; first5 points/houses/aspects, independent toggles
  Wheel --> User : all source points / true anchors / exact-working aspects
 else selected unique aspect
  Facts --> User : one aspect, all participants, their published houses
  Wheel --> User : selected pair; background without line or marker
 end
 alt current SVG failure
  Wheel --> Facts : typed local image failure
  Facts --> User : image warning; same accepted HTML facts remain
 else current valid frame
  Wheel --> User : passive SVG of same accepted DTO
 end
else confirmed empty / chart_unavailable
 API --> Page : no ChartDTO, permitted birth
 Page -> Facts : remove numeric facts / selection / image
 Facts --> User : empty / unavailable explanation, permitted draft/birth
else failed safe read
 API --> Page : existing error or network failure
 Page -> Page : no acceptance of failed data
 Page --> User : keep confirmed facts/draft, existing recheck
end
note over Page, Facts
No automatic build or domain recalculation.
Ordinary current preserves addressable selection and three disclosures.
F5 starts without selection and with first5 tables.
Live changed-birth target confirmation resets once; see003 and technical005.
source=current / identity does not prove an own committed goal.
end note
@enduml
